flowchart LR
  subgraph browser[Browser / HTTPS Preview or published site]
    ui[React SPA<br/>TypeScript · Tailwind · Router · Recharts]
    state[Demo fixtures<br/>explicitly labeled · Phase 1 only]
    ui --> state
  end
  subgraph app[SmartAttend application service]
    proxy[Relative /api route<br/>Vite proxy in development]
    auth[Flask auth & role authorization<br/>Manus OAuth · JWT session]
    api[Flask REST blueprints<br/>students · staff · attendance · reports]
    device[Flask device API<br/>HTTPS · idempotent events]
    ml[Prediction service<br/>pandas · numpy · scikit-learn]
    audit[Audit events · structured logs]
    proxy --> auth
    proxy --> api
    proxy --> device
    api --> audit
    auth --> audit
    device --> audit
  end
  subgraph persistence[Manus-managed relational database]
    mysql[(MySQL-compatible DB<br/>runtime DATABASE_URL)]
    bootstrap[Single-use first-Admin bootstrap state]
    mysql --> bootstrap
  end
  subgraph devices[Raspberry Pi devices]
    pi[Pi agent<br/>device credential · queued events]
    sensor[Pluggable sensor adapter<br/>type not yet selected]
    sensor --> pi
  end
  ui -->|same-origin HTTPS /api| proxy
  api -->|SQLAlchemy · migrations| mysql
  auth -->|user and role lookup| mysql
  device -->|sessions · idempotency · health| mysql
  mysql --> ml
  ml -->|versioned forecast and risk output| mysql
  pi -->|HTTPS JSON · heartbeat · event ID| device
